turned into a product by a manufacturer,
which is sold onto a wholesaler.

25
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:40,420
The wholesaler sells it onto a retailer,
who sells it onto a consumer.

26
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:43,380
And value is created along the chain.

27
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,100
So a commodity is pulled out the ground
for a dollar.

28
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:50,800
That commodity is processed by a
manufacturer into a product for $2.

29
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,920
Sold onto the wholesaler for $3.

30
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:57,700
Wholesaler sells it to retailer for $4.

31
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,700
Retailer sells it to consumer for $10.

32
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:04,520
And value is created along the chain from
nothing.

33
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,440
That's the value chain.

